§§ `F. Minimum, s 348(b) with Schedule K, 2026`

-- F1: item 1, a month in Q1: January's minimum wage 6,247.67.
#ASSERT `the minimum income under Schedule K for` `item 1, an employee` `, for` (`fid month` 2) `, under` `fid 2026 figures` `and` (JUST `fid 2026 minimum wages`) EQUALS 6247.67
