#ASSERT `s 348 — the income on which contributions are computed, for` (`fid employee case` 2026 (`fid month` 2) 6247.66) `, under` `fid 2026 figures` EQUALS 6247.67
#ASSERT `s 348 — the income on which contributions are computed, for` (`fid employee case` 2026 (`fid month` 2) 6247.67) `, under` `fid 2026 figures` EQUALS 6247.67
#ASSERT `s 348 — the income on which contributions are computed, for` (`fid employee case` 2026 (`fid month` 2) 6247.68) `, under` `fid 2026 figures` EQUALS 6247.68
